users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Private Scheduler preparation now rejects corrupt persisted bindings without refunding ambiguous capacity. Mandatory MissionController and LAN test inventories are preserved, and an additive Windows/Ubuntu qualifier checks the existing 30 Scheduler cases plus six integrity regressions.\n\nCurrent HEAD: `bfa3b24d8f209d5e91acfa64819d3ebed4967af7`\nTree: `0145968d0492f0a87d3e1a7e1eecc0b34a0c4a98`\nStacked base: PR81 `e869d8365c7e54ed3da3739d9cdf15948f37f022`.\n\nThe Windows preparation job at prior HEAD96 failed an ordinary-Git preflight before executing the 36 tests. The repair explicitly selects `C:/Program Files/Git/bin/git.exe`, retains all ordinary-file/single-link/ancestor checks, and creates external bootstrap evidence before those checks. Unsafe paths are rejected before descendant inspection or byte reads. No PATH fallback, relaxed guard, larger test deadline, skipped mandatory test, or security-workflow removal.\n\nValidation for current exact HEAD:\n- Fresh LF/single-link checkout: all 1,870 raw Git blobs match before and after.\n- 27 pure controls PASS, zero skips. This includes 12 preparation guard controls, six Mission/trigger controls, nine LAN inventory controls.\n- Exact receipt SHA256: `2187014bfa2371cc8216c96e43a3cb46b6d842f28bea3d59e1d7b9ec6661f2f3`.\n- Independent static review corrected the diagnostic read-before-ancestry regression before publication.\n- New-source hosted CI is pending; current Windows36 is NOT claimed PASS.\n\nHistorical hosted qualification at exact `96b1790` is retained separately: Mission58 Windows/Ubuntu; LAN68 (+9 controls) both OSes; Component161 four cells; Supervisor132 both OSes; Gateway25 (+8 controls) both OSes; preparation Ubuntu36 (+9 controls). Original nine ZIPs match GitHub digests; report SHA256 `99e5da8b1a583a7577fde4d1632177c4c52c10b982e526c3d6dec545a048cce5`. LAN exports one source map plus its pinned pre/post assertion; Gateway exports log receipts rather than a full per-file map.\n\nFull CI at96 was 26 SUCCESS /10 FAILURE /1 CANCELLED. Broad Windows native phase timeouts and MUX disconnects remain; six-source Ubuntu3.11 job130055333690 failed heartbeat fixture readiness (renewed.get timeout). Targeted successes do not close F26 or full CI. Original RED logs/artifacts are preserved, including c999 runner-context configuration failure and96 Windows preflight failure. No manual rerun or cancellation.\n\nThe new `release/integration-snapshots/20261110-root96.json` freezes six observed repository HEAD/tree pairs, node roles, contract ownership, CI gaps and restrictions. It is a source observation, explicitly NOT an admitted release candidate or executed six-repository assembly.\n\nStrict D4 Option1 remains enforced with logical mutations DISABLED. Public submit DENY; provider sends, real trading, physical fault injection, production deployment, protected merge and Tailscale removal remain blocked. Existing LS5 LEVEL1 scope is retained; LEVEL2/native scientific publication and authenticated final visibility are not accepted.\n\nMASTER MISSION: IN_PROGRESS / NO-GO.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:34:54Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T20:37:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"57c05b1fb2fe9572ceff4a1505525ca3a3c2c414","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/level2-preparation-integration-20261110","ref":"feature/level2-preparation-integration-20261110","repo":{"id":1434933263,"node_id":"R_kgDOVYdYDw","name":"unified-system","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/unified-system","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","follow